{{Term/Store|Stone Chest|Stone Chests|Series, BotW|plural}} are recurring [[Object]]s in {{TLoZ Series}}.{{Exp Game|BotW}}<ref>{{Cite Guide|BotW Piggyback|page= 377}}</ref>{{Name Ref|TotK}} Stone Chests go unnamed in {{AoC}}.

==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Stub|BotW}}

==={{TotK|-}}===
There are two varieties of Stone Chest that can be found throughout [[Hyrule]]. The first kind is fashioned in a [[Zonai]] style with carved green stone. These typically appear wherever Zonai architecture and influences are found, and they are utilized in the [[Sky]], on the [[Surface]], and throughout the [[Depths]]. A second kind with more crudely carved stone is also found predominately on the Surface and in [[Cave]]s.

Both varieties of Stone Chest are immobile and cannot be manipulated with [[Ultrahand]]. Like other [[Treasure Chest]]s, they cannot be [[Fuse]]d. They also cannot be broken by any means.

